1️. Top 3 Best-Selling Products by Quantity Sold
db.orders.aggregate([
  {
    $group: {
      _id: "$productName",
      totalQuantity: { $sum: "$quantity" }
    }
  },
  { $sort: { totalQuantity: -1 } },
  { $limit: 3 }
])

2. Total Revenue for Each Product Category
db.orders.aggregate([
